[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 900.87, "timestamp": "00:15:00", "text": "就像 Booth 一样，因为 Booth 实际上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 904.949, "timestamp": "00:15:04", "text": "并不常见，就像普通人买的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 908.23, "timestamp": "00:15:08", "text": "你知道，是西方人干的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 910.31, "timestamp": "00:15:10", "text": "所以很多东西都像这样……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 912.79, "timestamp": "00:15:12", "text": "展位就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 916.629, "timestamp": "00:15:16", "text": "并非完全可用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 918.47, "timestamp": "00:15:18", "text": "而且拥有这种能力的人不多，对吧？所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 921.67, "timestamp": "00:15:21", "text": "就像一个VTuber瓶子，但它不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 924.31, "timestamp": "00:15:24", "text": "很多人都想知道。我当然会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 925.59, "timestamp": "00:15:25", "text": "提到艺术家以及其他一切的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 927.509, "timestamp": "00:15:27", "text": "我用他们的模型，但用的人不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 929.67, "timestamp": "00:15:29", "text": "批量生产的也有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 937.91, "timestamp": "00:15:37", "text": "呃，已经做过了。是的，就像我有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 941.509, "timestamp": "00:15:41", "text": "我是个赌徒。我会实话实说。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 943.75, "timestamp": "00:15:43", "text": "有赌瘾，但不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 945.75, "timestamp": "00:15:45", "text": "现实生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 947.75, "timestamp": "00:15:47", "text": "这不是现实生活中的游戏。我不花钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 949.99, "timestamp": "00:15:49", "text": "把钱花在老虎机之类的东西上。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 954.949, "timestamp": "00:15:54", "text": "所有战利品箱。啊。我的天啊。所以，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 958.47, "timestamp": "00:15:58", "text": "那900美元中的900美元，我想大概是400美元。"}]